sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External gRPC Client
    participant API as ModelMeshApi<br/>8033/TCP gRPC
    participant MM as ModelMesh Core<br/>Model Lifecycle
    participant etcd as etcd<br/>KVTable Registry
    participant Sidecar as SidecarModelMesh<br/>Runtime Bridge
    participant Runtime as Model Runtime<br/>UDS or 8085/TCP
    participant Remote as Remote ModelMesh<br/>Instance (litelinks)

    Note over Client,Runtime: Inference Request Flow (Local Model)
    Client->>API: gRPC Request<br/>Header: mm-model-id=model-123
    API->>MM: Extract model ID<br/>Route request
    MM->>etcd: Lookup model state<br/>KVTable (128 buckets)
    etcd-->>MM: Model state: LOADED<br/>Instance: local

    MM->>Sidecar: Forward to local runtime
    Sidecar->>Runtime: ModelRuntime.predict()<br/>UDS: /tmp/mmesh/grpc.sock
    Runtime-->>Sidecar: Prediction result
    Sidecar-->>MM: Response
    MM-->>API: Forward response
    API-->>Client: gRPC Response

    Note over Client,Remote: Inference Request Flow (Remote Model)
    Client->>API: gRPC Request<br/>Header: mm-model-id=model-456
    API->>MM: Extract model ID<br/>Route request
    MM->>etcd: Lookup model state
    etcd-->>MM: Model state: LOADED<br/>Instance: remote-instance-2

    MM->>Remote: Forward via litelinks (Thrift)<br/>Inter-instance mesh
    Remote-->>MM: Prediction result
    MM-->>API: Forward response
    API-->>Client: gRPC Response

    Note over MM,etcd: Model Lifecycle Management
    MM->>etcd: Register model<br/>State: NOT_LOADED
    MM->>Sidecar: Load model request
    Sidecar->>Runtime: ModelRuntime.loadModel()
    Runtime-->>Sidecar: Model loaded
    Sidecar-->>MM: Load complete
    MM->>etcd: Update state: LOADED

    Note over MM,etcd: VModel Zero-Downtime Update
    MM->>etcd: Create VModel alias<br/>active=v1, target=v2
    MM->>Sidecar: Load target model v2
    Sidecar->>Runtime: ModelRuntime.loadModel(v2)
    Runtime-->>Sidecar: v2 loaded
    MM->>etcd: Transition VModel<br/>active=v2
    MM->>Sidecar: Unload old model v1
    Sidecar->>Runtime: ModelRuntime.unloadModel(v1)
